We conducted experiments on four long-text datasets with different tasks. The token-wise (Figure 2 (c)) tasks are not included because they mostly barely need information from adjacent sentences, and are ﬁnally transformed into multiple sequence-level samples. The boxplot in Figure 5 illustrates the statistics of the text length in the datasets.
